  "details": "After the local player has left the instance, `Update()` still gets called.\nHowever, some variables such as `Networking.LocalPlayer` will be invalid.\nThis causes errors, unless we modify our `Update()` loops to check if `LocalPlayer` is valid - which isn't intuitive or efficient. It would be better if `Update()` wasn't called.",
